#: ../../source/docs/common-do-land-start.rst:5
#: e3d759f733f64a33b6d906df955f5311
msgid "Using DO_LAND_START"
msgstr "使用DO_LAND_START"

#: ../../source/docs/common-do-land-start.rst:7
#: d334f87647ec45a9ba34b664549ad606
msgid ""
"The :ref:`DO_LAND_START <mav_cmd_do_land_start>` mission item can be used "
"for two purposes:"
msgstr ":ref:`DO_LAND_START <mav_cmd_do_land_start>` 任务项可用于两个目的："

#: ../../source/docs/common-do-land-start.rst:9
#: 17f58d9ddbf94ed7b4e5a91258a42599
msgid ""
"In Plane, to provide an automatic re-attempt for an aborted NAV_LAND "
"autolanding in a mission. (See :ref:`aborting-autolanding`)"
msgstr "在Plane中，为任务中中止的NAV_LAND自动着陆提供自动重试。（参见 :ref:`aborting-autolanding`）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-do-land-start.rst:10
#: 1c7d4895512e472cb65f48c4dfae6e68
msgid ""
"To provide an automatic landing sequence for RTLs in Plane or as a failsafe "
"action in Copter."
msgstr "为Plane的RTL提供自动着陆序列，或作为Copter的失控保护动作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-do-land-start.rst:12
#: cbb353e782714f9cbd83c42093a75116
msgid ""
"in Rover, it can be used, but only via Scripting call to start the landing "
"sequence."
msgstr "在Rover中，可以使用，但仅通过脚本调用来启动着陆序列。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-do-land-start.rst:15
#: 4d2b22a48d374b36b31781189108386a
msgid ""
"To trigger an automatic landing as part of an RTL(return to launch) you need"
" to do two things:"
msgstr "要将自动降落作为 RTL（返回起飞点）的一部分触发，你需要做两件事："

#: ../../source/docs/common-do-land-start.rst:17
#: 061f09050e0941b9830cc1a1b3670256
msgid ""
"add a :ref:`DO_LAND_START <mav_cmd_do_land_start>` mission item to your "
"mission, just before the start of your landing sequence which sets up the "
"approach waypoints and ends with a NAV_LAND item."
msgstr ""
"在任务中添加一个 :ref:`DO_LAND_START <mav_cmd_do_land_start>` "
"任务项，紧接在降落序列开始之前；该序列包含进近航点，并以 NAV_LAND 项结束。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-do-land-start.rst:18
#: 87d3fad6758e42dda99a730791945f15
msgid "set the :ref:`RTL_AUTOLAND <RTL_AUTOLAND>` parameter to 1 or 2"
msgstr "将 :ref:`RTL_AUTOLAND <RTL_AUTOLAND>` 参数设置为 1 或 2"

#: ../../source/docs/common-do-land-start.rst:20
#: 062b3b69644644ad84466e170c3b4679
msgid ""
"The exact behaviour depends on the :ref:`RTL_AUTOLAND<RTL_AUTOLAND>` value: "
"-  If :ref:`RTL_AUTOLAND<RTL_AUTOLAND>` = 1, then the plane will first RTL "
"as normal, then when it starts circling the return point (home or a rally "
"point) it will then switch to the AUTO mission after the ``DO_LAND_START`` -"
"  If :ref:`RTL_AUTOLAND<RTL_AUTOLAND>` = 2, then the plane will bypass the "
"RTL completely and go straight to the landing sequence after the "
"``DO_LAND_START``."
msgstr ""
"确切行为取决于 :ref:`RTL_AUTOLAND<RTL_AUTOLAND>` 的值：- 如果 "
":ref:`RTL_AUTOLAND<RTL_AUTOLAND>` = 1，飞机将首先正常执行 RTL，然后在开始绕返回点（Home "
"或集结点）盘旋时，切换到 ``DO_LAND_START`` 之后的 AUTO 任务 - 如果 "
":ref:`RTL_AUTOLAND<RTL_AUTOLAND>` = 2，飞机将完全跳过 RTL，直接跳转到 ``DO_LAND_START`` "
"之后的降落序列。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-do-land-start.rst:24
#: f43106daf55945c28fe43ea6ca0cfdae
msgid ""
"the \"landing sequence\" whose start is the ``DO_LAND_START`` marker, does "
"not actually have to include a landing! it can be any sequence of valid "
"mission commands. For example, flying to a location, and changing to an "
"indefinite VTOL loiter (applies only to a QuadPlane, obviously)."
msgstr ""
"以 ``DO_LAND_START`` 标记开始的「降落序列」并不一定真的要包含一次降落！它可以是任意有效任务指令的组合。例如，飞到某个位置后切换为 "
"VTOL 无限期 Loiter（显然此例只适用于 QuadPlane）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-do-land-start.rst:26
#: 89b16472949a458f82c543c64f0b6112
msgid ""
"ArduPilot checks to see if there is a ``DO_LAND_START`` mission items before"
" arming, and :ref:`RTL_AUTOLAND<RTL_AUTOLAND>` is set to 0. If so, a pre-arm"
" failure condition will prevent arming. If it is desired to use a "
"``DO_LAND_START`` only for aborted autolandings and not as an RTL action "
"override, then set :ref:`RTL_AUTOLAND<RTL_AUTOLAND>` = 3, to allow arming. "
"Its use for an aborted autolanding is explained in :ref:`aborting-"
"autolanding`."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 在解锁前会检查是否存在 ``DO_LAND_START`` 任务项，以及 "
":ref:`RTL_AUTOLAND<RTL_AUTOLAND>` 是否设置为 0。如果是，预解锁失败条件将阻止解锁。如果希望仅将 "
"``DO_LAND_START`` 用于中止自动降落而非作为 RTL 动作覆盖，则将 :ref:`RTL_AUTOLAND<RTL_AUTOLAND>`"
" = 3，以允许解锁。其用于中止自动降落的说明见 :ref:`aborting-autolanding`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-do-land-start.rst:28
#: 7b2d24c60a48411782727aac8beb47bf
msgid ""
"if you execute an RTL due to a battery failsafe and the "
":ref:`MIS_OPTIONS<MIS_OPTIONS>` bit 1 (Use distance to land) is set, then if"
" continuing the mission results in a closer landing point, then the mission "
"will proceed."
msgstr ""
"如果由于电池失控保护而执行 RTL，且已设置 :ref:`MIS_OPTIONS<MIS_OPTIONS>` 第 1 "
"位（使用到降落点的距离），则如果继续任务会导致更近的降落点，任务将继续进行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-do-land-start.rst:33
#: 3d1e0af6a82e4197bd939fafdf240b0a
msgid ""
"You can optionally include more than one ``DO_LAND_START`` mission item in "
"your mission. If that is done then the latitude/longitude/altitude of the "
"``DO_LAND_START`` mission items is used to choose which landing sequence to "
"use. The ``DO_LAND_START`` closest to the current location in all three "
"dimensions is used. This can be useful if you have multiple landing "
"sequences for different wind conditions or different areas."
msgstr ""
"您可以在任务中选择性地包含多个 ``DO_LAND_START`` 任务项。若如此设置，则使用 ``DO_LAND_START`` "
"任务项的纬度/经度/高度来选择使用哪个着陆序列。选取在三维空间中距当前位置最近的 "
"``DO_LAND_START``。这在针对不同风向条件或不同区域设置多个着陆序列时非常有用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-do-land-start.rst:35
#: fec1be97749b45caa0a8bf6de654db7e
msgid ""
"If you are already in a landing sequence (NAV_LAND or DO_START_LAND "
"sequence), then it will continue."
msgstr "若已在着陆序列（NAV_LAND或DO_START_LAND序列）中，则将继续执行。"

#~ msgid "To use, you need to do two things:"
#~ msgstr "使用时需执行两步："

#~ msgid ""
#~ "use ``DO_LAND_START`` as a failsafe action. For example, setting "
#~ ":ref:`FS_THR_ENABLE<FS_THR_ENABLE>` = \"6\" for RC failsafe."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "将 ``DO_LAND_START`` 用作失控保护动作。例如，将 :ref:`FS_THR_ENABLE<FS_THR_ENABLE>` "
#~ "设置为「6」用于RC失控保护。"
